  "prefLabel": "Puc 802.03 Damage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 802.03 “Damage” means any impact or exposure that results in the need to repair an underground facility due to the weakening or the partial or complete destruction of the underground facility, including, but not limited to, the protective coating, lateral support, corrosion control, or the housing for the line, device, or underground facility.\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #9226, INTERIM, eff 8-16-08; ss and moved by #9318, eff 11-8-08 (from Puc 802.02); ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
